      "role": "user",
      "content": "35mph seems a bit low for a crash that totaled a luxury SUV like that. are you sure the data is reading it correctly? can you show me the speed progression in the 10 seconds leading up to the impact? i want to make sure there wasn't a sudden spike we missed.",
